## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
ADP benefits from a sticky business model with high switching costs and recurring revenue streams. While peers like Workday or Paychex face competitive pressures, ADP’s superior margins and balance sheet provide resilience.  

**Bull Case:** ADP continues to grow FCF and expand its market share through strategic acquisitions.  
**Bear Case:** Economic downturns reduce corporate spending on HR services, impacting revenue growth.  

